==Battleground==
*2 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 43.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Cadaver Bear]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 56.67~60 seconds<sup>1,700f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A fairly simple, but difficult [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]]-filled stage. You are rushed by Coffin Zoges and a Zir Zeal, with more Zir Zeals spawning later. Cadaver Bear spawns after only ~36 seconds, so you do not have time to save up for much. Any cheap [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]] will be extremely useful here, like [[Mighty Aethur Ltd. (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Aethur Ltd.]] Otherwise, any cheap unit that can slow Cadaver Bear's advance or knock him back, like a well-timed [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]], will also help. Taking out the Coffin Zoges / Zir Zeals as quickly as possible will be helpful, such as [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] for the Coffin Zoges or [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] + a [[Zombie Killer|Zombie Kill]] from [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] or something similar.

If you don't want to play the stage normally, you can force burrow Cadaver with something like [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]], then sending out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] and then stalling Cadaver Bear until Bahamut annihilates the stage.

